    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Rainforest's same as ever, huh."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "It's been a really long time, hasn't it, Gavial?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Never liked this place. Air's stifling, and the ground gives too easy. Can't place a single firm step."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "A lot of tribes have moved into the rainforest, though."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "That so? ...Hey, Doctor, looks like you're up. How'd you sleep last night?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Decent.;......;I've never felt more alive.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "You adapt fast, huh, Doctor? Hell, I thought you wouldn't be able to stand roughing it out here."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Haha. Your eyes say it all."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Yeah, I'd believe you if you weren't trying to rub your temples."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Didn't I tell you, Doctor? Gotta be ready. It's not about to get any easier."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Here. Scrounged up what I could find nearby to make some soup. Go on, it'll wake you up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Hey, speaking of which. Never realized it until I went looking, but actually, there's a hell of a lot of medicinal plants that grow around this rainforest."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "...Gavial's actually taking care of people..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "G... Gavial, I didn't sleep good either..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Huh? And you call yourself an Archosauria?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Archosauria... *wail* Gavial doesn't remember our original name..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Hmm? Oh, crap, I did forget. I mean Tiacauh, don't I."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Damn, I don't think I've used that word at all since I left. Doctor, you make a note to yourself. We don't divvy ourselves up by race here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I mean, from that perspective, uh, lemme think... I'm an Archosauria, Zumama's a Phidia, and there's also Liberi... yeah, that's your three, more or less."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "But we all count ourselves as Tiacauh. Means 'one valiant in war' in our language."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Also, not that I think you're gonna need it, but you might like to know we call this place Acahualla. 'Land where the forest overgrows.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Alright, enough bawling your eyes out. Get your people in gear and let's move."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "(Whimper)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Rhodes Island. Doctor..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Oh, yeah, right. So, a company is..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Ah, I know that! Since you left, Gavial, I've been learning about the outside world!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Oh yeah? That adds up. You dress different from how you used to, too, now that I think about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Yep! This is really fashionable on the outside!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I don't really get fashion. Is she right, Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "I've seen it in magazines.;......;I have no idea.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
