    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Traditionally, every tribe of Acahualla, big and small, joins in this ceremony where we choose the next Great Chief."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Oh, and the ceremony a trial by combat. Whoever beats all the other challengers and earns their recognition gets the right to challenge the current Great Chief."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "If they defeat the Great Chief, they become the new one."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Now the power of the Great Chief? Every tribe listens to what she says, for starters!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Sounds like nothing's really changed, then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Something has!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "One day, the last Great Chieftain Juan drank too much and his wife chased him to the edge of a cliffside. He jumped off it and never came back. Our last ceremony was to pick his successor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "But some stuff happened with Gavial and we never chose a Great Chief. And ever since Gavial left, none of the tribes have really gotten along with each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "So now we've all been stuck fighting each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "image",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "A former Great Chief...?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Wuh? That part's actually normal for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "My dad said Great Chief Juan was one of the longest Great Chiefs ever. We'd usually get a new one every two or three years."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Whenever we lose a Great Chief's, we do the ceremony to pick a new one."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Now what was that about Gavial?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "What? Oh, yeah, I never told anybody at Rhodes Island about that stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I beat every single comer to the whole damn thing and then I left."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Because they ostracized you?;Every single one?!",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Yeah. I was pissed. Went and knocked all their lights out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
            "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Anyway, that's another story. Any especially strong tribes running around?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "A bunch of them are pretty powerful now."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
