        "text": "First is the one that Zumama leads, the Eunectes tribe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "She settled her tribe in another part of the rainforest near a lot of ore veins. She has a hold on most of our metal resources."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "That tribe always liked making weird tools and weapon things. They've absorbed a lot of the small tribes that surrounded them."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
