    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Second is Kemar's Flint tribe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "The rainforest Tiacauh don't live quite the same as the rest of us. They're a lot more scattered. Normally, they don't even communicate with us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "But because we have no Great Chief, a lot of tribes ended up going into the rainforest."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi",
        "text": "Kemar's is one of them now."
    },
