    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "I can picture it right now. Zumama setting her tribe up next to a mine. Yeah, ever since way back, she's loved making those weapons of hers or whatever."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gavial",
        "text": "Wouldn't have thought she'd be bossing a clan now, though. 'Eunectes' has a nice ring to it!"
