        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_071"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A",
        "text": "What? Obviously! Take a look at mine! Sturdy! Strong! Plump and plush! What's better than a nice thick tail like this, huh?!"
